00:00:04.917 --> 00:00:09.388
I recently sat down with Chelsea Handler on her podcast, Dear Chelsea.
我最近上了切尔西·汉德ler的播客节目《亲爱的切尔西》。

00:00:09.388 --> 00:00:10.601
It was so much fun.
真的太有趣了。

00:00:10.601 --> 00:00:21.841
We talked about how we met, how we made out 20 years ago, sobriety, navigating fame, marriage, my love for New York City, and we got to give some advice to Chelsea's listeners.
我们聊了我们是怎么认识的、20年前我们怎么舌吻的、戒酒经历、如何应付名气、婚姻、我对纽约市的爱，我们还给切尔西的听众们提供了一些建议。

00:00:21.841 --> 00:00:26.759
We're dropping my conversation with Chelsea into the feed here for you today.
今天我们把我和切尔西的这段对话放到了这里的节目源里供大家收听。

00:00:26.759 --> 00:00:28.994
This is a great podcast every week.
这每周都是一个非常棒的播客。

00:00:28.994 --> 00:00:39.084
Chelsea, along with her co-host, Catherine Law, and some pretty great guests, takes on listener questions with that hilarious unfiltered edge she's known for.
切尔西与她的联合主持凯瑟琳·劳以及一些相当不错的嘉宾一起，以她一贯搞笑且毫无保留的犀利风格来解答听众的问题。

00:00:39.084 --> 00:00:47.387
One minute, you'll be laughing about sex and weed, and the next, you're having a deeply moving conversation about grief or family.
上一分钟，你还在为性和大麻开怀大笑，下一分钟，你就在进行关于悲伤或家庭的深情动人的对话。

00:00:47.387 --> 00:00:51.283
It manages to be inspirational and heartbreaking all at once.
它既能给人启迪，又让人心碎，两者完美结合。

00:00:51.283 --> 00:00:55.306
You can check out Dear Chelsea, wherever you get your podcasts.
你可以在任何收听播客的地方找到《亲爱的切尔西》。

00:00:55.306 --> 00:01:05.205
