You integrated that, Chelsea, amazing.
你把它融入生活了，切尔西，太棒了。

00:35:46.150 --> 00:35:49.289
Yeah, and you have hobbies, you like pottery.
对，你还有爱好，你喜欢陶艺。

00:35:49.289 --> 00:35:52.489
It's more like, like I said, I like love his girlfriend.
更像是，就像我说的，我很喜欢他的女朋友。

00:35:52.489 --> 00:35:54.389
I think she's fantastic.
我觉得她棒极了。

00:35:54.389 --> 00:36:02.909
I just realized like when he got into the relationship that my identity was like more closely tied.
我只是突然意识到，当他谈恋爱后，我的自我认同和他的联系得更紧密了。

00:36:02.909 --> 00:36:05.829
And like right now, it's fantastic and amazing.
就像现在这样，其实挺棒也挺奇妙的。

00:36:05.829 --> 00:36:06.670
Everybody's out here.
大家都外出活动。

